draftNoticeBody:
FROM: {{sender}}
TO: {{recipient}}
RE: Demand for payment

1. Under {{basis}} between us, the amount of {{amount}} owed by you fell due on {{dueDate}}.
2. We request payment of this amount within {{deadlineDays}} days of receipt of this letter.
3. If payment is not made within this period, we reserve the right to take legal steps.

Date: [ dd.mm.yyyy ]
Signature: {{sender}}

