draftU_termination_notice_body:
FROM: {{from}}
TO: {{to}}
SUBJECT: Notice of termination

FACTS:
I hereby give notice to end the following contract: {{contractType}}, reference {{contractRef}}.
Requested end date: {{endDate}}.
Reason: {{reason}}

REQUEST: Please confirm in writing that you have received this notice and the end date, and tell me about any final settlement or items to return.
DEADLINE: Please reply within [ number of days ] days of receiving this letter.

ATTACHMENTS: [ copy of the contract, previous correspondence ]
Date: [ dd.mm.yyyy ]
Signature: {{from}}

draftU_deposit_return_request_body:
FROM: {{from}}
TO: {{to}}
SUBJECT: Request to return the deposit

FACTS:
Property: {{property}}
Deposit paid: {{depositAmount}}
The property was handed back on {{handoverDate}}.

REQUEST: Please return the deposit in full, or send me a written, itemised list of any deductions with supporting evidence.
Payment details: {{paymentDetails}}
DEADLINE: Please pay or reply within {{deadlineDays}} days of receiving this letter.

ATTACHMENTS: [ deposit receipt, handover record, photos ]
Date: [ dd.mm.yyyy ]
Signature: {{from}}

draftU_repair_or_defect_notice_body:
FROM: {{from}}
TO: {{to}}
SUBJECT: Notice of defect and request for repair

FACTS:
Item / property: {{item}}
First noticed on: {{noticedDate}}
Problem:
{{problem}}

REQUEST: Please repair or otherwise remedy the defect and confirm a date for the work in writing.
DEADLINE: Please reply within {{deadlineDays}} days of receiving this letter.

ATTACHMENTS: [ photos, videos, invoices, previous messages ]
Date: [ dd.mm.yyyy ]
Signature: {{from}}

draftU_rent_increase_objection_body:
FROM: {{from}}
TO: {{to}}
SUBJECT: Objection to the proposed rent increase

FACTS:
Property: {{property}}
Current rent: {{currentRent}}
Proposed rent: {{proposedRent}}
Increase notice received on: {{noticeDate}}

REQUEST: I do not accept the increase as proposed. Please send me, in writing, how the new amount was calculated and what it is based on.
I am open to discussing this alternative: {{counterOffer}}
DEADLINE: Please reply within [ number of days ] days of receiving this letter.

ATTACHMENTS: [ copy of the lease, the increase notice ]
Date: [ dd.mm.yyyy ]
Signature: {{from}}

draftU_unpaid_wages_request_body:
FROM: {{from}}
TO: {{to}}
SUBJECT: Request for payment of outstanding wages

FACTS:
Period: {{period}}
Outstanding amount: {{unpaidAmount}}
Details:
{{details}}

REQUEST: Please pay the outstanding amount and send me a written breakdown (payslip) for the period above.
DEADLINE: Please pay or reply within {{deadlineDays}} days of receiving this letter.

ATTACHMENTS: [ employment contract, payslips, bank statements, timesheets ]
Date: [ dd.mm.yyyy ]
Signature: {{from}}

draftU_personal_data_access_request_body:
FROM: {{from}}
TO: {{to}}
SUBJECT: Request for access to my personal data

FACTS:
Account / customer reference: {{accountRef}}
Data concerned: {{scope}}

REQUEST: Please send me:
1. a copy of the personal data you hold about me;
2. the purposes for which it is used;
3. who it has been shared with, or the categories of recipients;
4. how long it will be kept, or how that period is decided.
Please send your reply to: {{replyTo}}
DEADLINE: Please reply within the time required by the rules that apply to you, and no later than [ number of days ] days.

ATTACHMENTS: [ proof of identity, if you ask for it ]
Date: [ dd.mm.yyyy ]
Signature: {{from}}

draftU_cancellation_request_body:
